[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3062599511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108507#issuecomment-3062599511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108507","id":3062599511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62i49X","user":{"login":"dementive","id":87823030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3ODIzMDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87823030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive","html_url":"https://github.com/dementive","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dementive/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T14:42:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T14:42:59Z","body":"\n> The reason is that `AHashMap` moves elements around in its data on change. Therefore, it is impossible to store pointers to mutable `AHashMap` elements. `Node` stores a pointer to `SceneTree::Group` within the hash map, which is the reason the address sanitizer fails in the unit tests.\n\nThanks for figuring that out, the asan error was really confusing to me. Makes sense now though, the comments in AHashMap do say exactly that.\n\nOn another note I saw that recently in the contributing docs a nice table comparing some of the data structures was added. Might be nice to add another column there about pointer invalidation for each data structure because it isn't very obvious how each of them behave without digging into the source code.\n\n\n> I recommend reverting the `AHashMap` change. It might be possible to pursue this change using pointers and explicit allocations, but I think that's out of scope and should be done in a follow-up PR.\n\n\nSound good will revert that 👍\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3062599511/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3534456992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108507#issuecomment-3534456992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108507","id":3534456992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Sq4ig","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T20:29:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T20:29:01Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3534456992/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]